menu "espOS sensors"

    config ESPOS_SENSORS_ONEWIRE
        bool "1-Wire and DS18B20 support"
        default n
        help
            Build espos_onewire.h: a 1-Wire bus and the DS18B20
            temperature sensors on it, over the registry components
            espressif/ds18b20 and espressif/onewire_bus.

            Off by default because turning it on downloads those two
            components and links the RMT driver they use. A firmware with
            no DS18B20 on it should pay for neither.

            The bus needs an external 4.7k pull-up to 3V3; the internal
            pull-up cannot supply a DS18B20 and the bus reads as empty.

    config ESPOS_SENSORS_MAX_GPIO_NODES
        int "GPIO change nodes"
        default 8
        range 1 32
        help
            How many GpioChange nodes can watch pins at once. Each holds
            the ISR trampoline that posts into the node's mailbox; the
            table is fixed so an interrupt never walks a list that
            something else is editing.

endmenu
